{"id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","title":"Homeomorphism","display":"df-homeomorphism — Homeomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homeomorphism","aliases":["58-df-homeomorphism","Homeomorphism"],"display":"df-homeomorphism — Homeomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homeomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homeomorphism</span><span>Homeomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homeomorphism — Homeomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Y^X\">\\(f\\in Y^X\\)</span> (map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S,\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S,\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Embedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Embedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Embedding}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow f[X]\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,f[X],\\{U\\cap f[X]:U\\in\\tau_Y\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Embedding}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow f[X]\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,f[X],\\{U\\cap f[X]:U\\in\\tau_Y\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash (X,\\tau_X)\\cong(Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash (X,\\tau_X)\\cong(Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Homeomorphism: bijective continuous map with continuous inverse</li>\n<li>Topological invariant: properties preserved by homeomorphism</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1 \\cong \\mathbb{R}/\\mathbb{Z}\">\\(S^1 \\cong \\mathbb{R}/\\mathbb{Z}\\)</span>, open balls <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong \\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\cong \\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span></li>\n<li>Classification: homeomorphism equivalence is coarser than diffeomorphism</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S,\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Embedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Embedding}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow f[X]\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{Homeomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,f[X],\\{U\\cap f[X]:U\\in\\tau_Y\\})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism} \\vdash (X,\\tau_X)\\cong(Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)","display":true},{"tex":"S^1 \\cong \\mathbb{R}/\\mathbb{Z}","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong \\mathbb{R}^n","display":false}],"bytes":1423,"backlinks":[{"id":"3f9e7fe466acfa12","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeo}_S$ (homeomorphism predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"2ff75bf9c7039be0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3f045a36dba6b5ef","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"0c88d7bf21633cb8","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 取 [[58-df-homeomorphism]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"ba4592cee3b1b3f0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"07d803337c0e6ed3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"1bab78124334e27a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"1af83a707331071f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9cc3cffe81d4e71b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"22483e8575313743","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeo}_S$ (homeomorphism predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"ab52c563964e3a2d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (homeomorphism predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphis